    {
      "source": "Extends <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/persistenceunit/DefaultPersistenceUnitManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.persistenceunit\"><code>DefaultPersistenceUnitManager</code></a> to merge configurations of one persistence unit residing in multiple\n<code>persistence.xml</code> files into one. This is necessary to allow the declaration of entities in separate modules.",
